{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":399055,\"title\":\"The Shape of Water\",\"tagline\":\"A fairy tale for troubled times.\",\"overview\":\"An other-worldly story, set against the backdrop of Cold War era America circa 1962, where a mute janitor working at a lab falls in love with an amphibious man being held captive there and devises a plan to help him escape.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9zfwPffUXpBrEP26yp0q1ckXDcj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abirSHwWgKajV3hXhaIR5lcCIXe.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":13240,\"year\":2017,\"runtime\":123,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":19500000,\"revenue\":195300000,\"director\":\"Guillermo del Toro\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":10828,\"name\":\"Guillermo del Toro\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gldeyCtKcaqnK1v4Vu9vqayhzUQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":39658,\"name\":\"Sally Hawkins\",\"character\":\"Elisa Esposito\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1dtDq82dM2YQ17lBL4ZKPJo5LKw.jpg\"},{\"id\":335,\"name\":\"Michael Shannon\",\"character\":\"Richard Strickland\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6mMczfjM8CiS1WuBOgo5Xom1TcR.jpg\"},{\"id\":28633,\"name\":\"Richard Jenkins\",\"character\":\"Giles\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/muT3RZG9hiKaKojD751RcQ5tGEy.jpg\"},{\"id\":6944,\"name\":\"Octavia Spencer\",\"character\":\"Zelda Fuller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zDGydyM1fmvNWzQlTAns9IZjNxT.jpg\"},{\"id\":72873,\"name\":\"Michael Stuhlbarg\",\"character\":\"Dr. Robert Hoffstetler\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aYB3SQm3h6ZyAdlbGyiNfakjx56.jpg\"},{\"id\":17005,\"name\":\"Doug Jones\",\"character\":\"Amphibian Man\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rpvvWATYWHGjedJea0G97XufOwU.jpg\"},{\"id\":5892,\"name\":\"David Hewlett\",\"character\":\"Fleming\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bm6Tjfaj7iuRLI0hkvxHBlP4pUO.jpg\"},{\"id\":12538,\"name\":\"Nick Searcy\",\"character\":\"General Hoyt\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AnqbYGdLLaUaMfCtE0zYiRiI7E6.jpg\"},{\"id\":16591,\"name\":\"Stewart Arnott\",\"character\":\"Bernard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/11yoRN9kamqEoGXtwGHvaeQMaVX.jpg\"},{\"id\":44208,\"name\":\"Nigel Bennett\",\"character\":\"Mihalkov\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaB8nZnEbGe8lIgZtoo1ObYSUEg.jpg\"},{\"id\":52394,\"name\":\"Lauren Lee Smith\",\"character\":\"Elaine Strickland\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9rpryFGqrUUafGRMhnd6fQAlzHc.jpg\"},{\"id\":5921,\"name\":\"Martin Roach\",\"character\":\"Brewster Fuller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tTyxAqRDIhyfqRQjM2Opeo42ESc.jpg\"},{\"id\":180937,\"name\":\"Allegra Fulton\",\"character\":\"Yolanda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hw5zfA4QVLK4WVgtVUfA1oXYn6N.jpg\"},{\"id\":55554,\"name\":\"John Kapelos\",\"character\":\"Mr. Arzounian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9buu5iq8FxJXMqMjmqEjm1zl2A6.jpg\"},{\"id\":54198,\"name\":\"Morgan Kelly\",\"character\":\"Pie Guy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f4MQjhvMyABRjW4Ia74zgDQFMmL.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":8966,\"title\":\"Twilight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward's repeated cautions, Bella can't stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18239,\"title\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF2c20sRDgySZLaLS2OUerL07sz.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she's thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150689,\"title\":\"Cinderella\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j91LJmcWo16CArFOoapsz84bwxb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7vmCCmyiHnuKGMzHZlr0fD44b9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella's fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4922,\"title\":\"The Curious Case of Benjamin Button\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26wEWZYt6yJkwRVkjcbwJEFh9IS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2fswjyrY3GEzeoVn6mF8pNeNcgf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Born under unusual circumstances, Benjamin Button springs into being as an elderly man in a New Orleans nursing home and ages in reverse. Twelve years after his birth, he meets Daisy, a child who flits in and out of his life as she grows up to be a dancer. Though he has all sorts of unusual adventures over the course of his life, it is his relationship with Daisy, and the hope that they will come together at the right time, that drives Benjamin forward.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":402431,\"title\":\"Wicked\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w22GVYotTIVC1dUd58mRhwPqiS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two's unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122906,\"title\":\"About Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ls6zswrOZVhCXQBh96DlbnLBajM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/einbto9qLXFx9QXxEHylaxDbKPx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The night after another unsatisfactory New Year's party, Tim's father reveals to him that the men in their family have the ability to travel through time. They can't change history, but they can change what happens and has happened in their own lives. Thus begins the start of a lesson in learning to appreciate life itself as it is, as it comes, and most importantly, the people living alongside us.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12797,\"title\":\"Ghost Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b8VS14DwpLlugTxVWSllYU0Gjn5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iDgK5UFgXKVqegWYc5tl58qfGOw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bertram Pincus, a cranky, people-hating Manhattan dentist, develops the unwelcome ability to see dead people. Really annoying dead people. Even worse, they all want something from him, particularly Frank Herlihy, a smooth-talking ghost, who pesters him into a romantic scheme involving his widow Gwen. They are soon entangled in a hilarious predicament between the now and the hereafter!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":293863,\"title\":\"The Age of Adaline\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3XFuCS6wBfpSnUQboLd1JtkJqe0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wTvDGO0xGMmnScqjuiDeWU7PkcB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After 29-year-old Adaline recovers from a nearly lethal accident, she inexplicably stops growing older. As the years stretch on and on, Adaline keeps her secret to herself  until she meets a man who changes her life.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11845,\"title\":\"Intimacy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aiPhBVo2eNhuPw5Pezx4BHagvUx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qoxriJ6n1qxvG1bBMPnsZBHKGco.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Failed musician Jay abandoned his family and now earns a living as head bartender in a trendy London pub. Every Wednesday afternoon, a woman comes to his house for graphic, almost wordless, sex. One day, Jay follows her and learns about her. This eventually disrupts their relationship.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5994,\"title\":\"The Family Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jack's lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843,\"title\":\"In the Mood for Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8BgGbbWiLNhPtkMkN0gGTnbtvBv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffQFnAUm2Uu4RU0nijpjPRf9TBT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1960s Hong Kong, two neighbors form an intimate bond after making a discovery about their spouses in this visually stunning tale of unrequited love.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"oRKnlUanptY\",\"name\":\"Official International Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"uiA4B5Y63IQ\",\"name\":\"Final Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"368_ovPsJk8\",\"name\":\"Red Band Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}